          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Multiple observations of a fast-moving fireball on a descending trajectory in the sky: likely observations of an atmospheric reentry.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "94e0000bfd26b2d5f277ee1d064fe83026a4ae14eb325a2dbc5778966b710c41"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
